OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after barber shop
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged in connection
OL,7,Fwith a stabbing at a barber shop.
OL,9,FWest Mercia Police were called to
OL,10,FEmpire Barbers on Deansway, Worcester,
OL,11,Fat around 15:15 GMT on Wednesday
OL,12,Ffollowing reports that a man in his 30s
OL,13,Fhad been seriously injured.
OL,15,FHe was later taken to hospital but his
OL,16,Finjuries were not thought to be life
OL,17,Fthreatening or life changing, police
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
